# Storefront Design System — Luxury Minimal

## Mental model

**Off-white paper, near-black ink, one warm gold accent.** Think high-end fashion
house — editorial, generous, restrained. Nothing decorative that doesn't earn
its place. This is a completely different visual language from the admin CMS.

## Hard rules

- **Never** use `v18-*` tokens, `v18-*` utility classes, or `V18Shell` /
  `V18Sidebar` / `V18TopNav` anywhere under `app/(storefront)/` or
  `components/storefront/`. Those are admin-only.
- The storefront has **no sidebar**. Chrome is `Navbar` (sticky, top) +
  `Footer` (bottom), both from `components/storefront/`.
- No notification bells, no avatars, no breadcrumb strings in the header, and
  no public link to `/admin`.

## Color tokens (globals.css @theme)

| Role | Token | Value |
|------|-------|-------|
| Primary text | `--color-store-ink` | `#0f0f0f` |
| Secondary text | `--color-store-ink-muted` | `#6b6b6b` |
| Page background | `--color-store-surface` | `#fafaf8` |
| Card surface | `--color-store-white` | `#ffffff` |
| Border (hairline) | `--color-store-border` | `#e8e6e1` |
| Accent | `--color-store-accent` | `#c8a96e` |
| Accent hover | `--color-store-accent-dark` | `#9d7f48` |

Gold is used **only** on CTAs, sale prices, and hover states. Never on
decoration, never as a background fill for large areas.

## Typography

- `--font-display` = Cormorant Garamond (300/400/500) — headings only
- `--font-sans` = DM Sans (400/500) — body, labels, nav, prices
- Never Inter, never Geist, never Roboto.
- Hero headline: display, 56–72px, weight 300, tracking -0.02em
- Section titles: display, 32–40px, weight 400
- Body / nav / labels: sans, 14–16px, weight 400
- Price: sans, weight 500

## Surface & spacing

- **Hairline borders only** — `1px solid var(--color-store-border)`.
- **No box shadows on storefront surfaces.** Elevation comes from whitespace.
- Section vertical padding ≥ 80px. Product grid gap ≥ 32px.
- Product imagery is always `object-cover`, aspect-ratio 3/4. Never distort.

## Motion

CSS transitions by default. Product card image scales to 1.03 over 400ms
ease-out. Page fades in over 200ms. No bounce, no spring. Respect
`prefers-reduced-motion` on every animation.

Do **not** import `framer-motion` into storefront components — CSS is enough
and it keeps these components on the server.

## Component defaults

- `ProductCard` — no border at rest; hairline appears on hover. Name, then
  price below. Sale price in accent with the original struck through.
- `Navbar` — sticky; transparent at scroll top, `--color-store-white` once
  scrolled. Nav links uppercase, tracking-widest, text-xs.
- `CategoryFilter` — left rail on desktop, bottom sheet on mobile. Pill tags,
  filled with accent when active.
- `SizeSelector` / `ColorSelector` — real radio groups. Out-of-stock sizes are
  struck through, non-interactive, and announced to assistive tech.
